OL,3,GNEWSAI only found out I had cancer
OL,4,Aafter my four-year-old kicked me in the
OL,5,Atesticles
OL,6,
OL,7,FBen Lidgey was "messing around" with
OL,8,Fhis son in the garden when he was
OL,9,Faccidentally kicked in the testicles -
OL,10,Fbut it may well have saved his life.
OL,12,FWhen he was still in pain after a week,
OL,13,Fhe sought medical help and found out he
OL,14,Fhad testicular cancer.
OL,16,FA new report from men's charity
OL,17,FMovember says a third of men in Wales
OL,18,Fdie before their 75th birthday, and
OL,19,Fcalls on the Welsh government to
OL,20,Fdevelop a dedicated plan for men's
OL,21,Fhealth.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
